<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.11 pct in wk to Feb 7.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.11 pct in wk to Feb 7.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's central bank said Monday liquidity in the bank system rose 1.11 percent to 17.28 billion sucres in the week to February 7.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1996 at 16.99 billion sucres, up 35.8 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>((-- Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
